= <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> Congress

The internal dissent within the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> has risen again with conflict over their participation in the referendum against the Serannus Plan[? if was_in_right_coalition == 1:&nbsp;and their withdrawal from the government[? if marcher_in_government == 1:&nbsp;leaving us in power?]?]. 

The "unity of the no" against <span style="color: #9B0000;">Vaelism</span> has been losing its force over the years, and now is the time for the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> to define itself through the next challenging years. [? if young_plan_signatures >= 10: The success of the Serannus Plan referendum to reach the adequate signatures has bolstered the current leadership.?][? if weimar_ref_signatures >= 30: The high support for the referendum for the revision of the constitution has bolstered the current leadership.?]

- @resultsdnvp: The congress unfolds...

@resultsdnvp
go-to: statusquo if ((young_plan_signatures >= 10 and pro_republic_8 < 70) or (weimar_ref_signatures >= 30 and pro_republic_8 >= 70) or (was_in_center_right_coalition == 1 and pro_republic_8 >= 70 and pro_republic < 70)) and not ((peoples_party == 1 or commons_marcher_normalized < 45 or unions_independent == 1 or commons_traditionalist_normalized >= 10) and not in_popular_front and not in_left_front); christiansocial if (peoples_party == 1 or commons_marcher_normalized < 45 or unions_independent == 1 or commons_traditionalist_normalized >= 10) and not in_popular_front and not in_left_front; youngconservative if ((young_plan_signatures < 10 and pro_republic_8 < 70) or (weimar_ref_signatures < 30 and pro_republic_8 >= 70) or (was_in_center_right_coalition == 1 and pro_republic_8 >= 70 and pro_republic >= 70)) and not ((peoples_party == 1 or commons_marcher_normalized < 45 or unions_independent == 1) and not in_popular_front and not in_left_front)

@statusquo
on-arrival: hergt_stays = 1; guild_dnf -= 2; guild_traditionalist += 2; burgher_traditionalist += 1; burgher_dnf -= 1; nationalism += 3; faithful_traditionalist += 3 if stegerwald_path; faithful_other -= 3 if stegerwald_path
face-image: img/portraits/OskarHergt.jpg

Despite some dissent from the more <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> forces within the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, the congress goes through without incident. The willingness of their leadership to negotiate with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> is certainly concerning.

[? if stegerwald_path: As a result of Sedgewick capturing the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>'s working-class voters, the party is refocusing to reach out to Faithful. ?]

@christiansocial
on-arrival: traditionalist_leader = "Maine"; commons_traditionalist += 20; commons_traditionalist += 5 if unions_independent; commons_marcher -= 5; commons_collectivist -= 2; unionist_commons -= 5 if stegerwald_path; labor_dissent += 10; guild_traditionalist -= 5; guild_dnf += 5; burgher_traditionalist += 2; burgher_other -= 2; commons_other -= 4; landed_traditionalist -= 6; landed_dnf += 4; landed_gold += 4; guild_gold += 6; burgher_gold += 6; landed_lvp += 4; guild_lvp += 6; burgher_lvp += 6; ddp_right += 1; gold_right += 2; lvp_right += 2
face-image: img/dnvpposter.jpg

The exodus of workers from our support base has greatly strengthened the <span style="color: #6D5298;">Faithful Socials</span> within the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, who seek to take advantage of our alienation of the Free Guilds. 

Caradoc Maine has been elected leader of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, a Free Guild leader and the center of discourse within their party in the last congress. He claims a middle ground between Reformism and capitalism, and to reconcile capital and labor, it remains to be seen how his leadership would impact the political landscape.

@youngconservative
on-arrival: traditionalist_leader = "Trevannon"; true_christian_democracy = 1; landed_dnf += 3; guild_dnf += 3; landed_other -= 3; guild_other -= 3; burgher_other -= 3; burgher_traditionalist += 3; commons_traditionalist += 1; faithful_traditionalist += 3; faithful_other -= 3; pro_republic += 5; gold_left += 2; ddp_left += 1; lvp_left += 2; faithful_traditionalist += 3 if stegerwald_path; faithful_other -= 3 if stegerwald_path
face-image: img/portraits/Treviranus.jpg

The reluctance for the party around Hargen and Westmore to fully commit to a democratic party has been increasingly under fire from the <span style="color: #6D5298;">Faithful Socials</span> and "Young Conservatives", and [? if young_plan_signatures < 10 and pro_republic_8 < 70: the failure for the referendum against the Serannus Plan to reach the signature threshold has tipped the balance in their favor?][? if weimar_ref_signatures < 30 and pro_republic_8 >= 70: the underperformance of the referendum for the revision of the Unity constitution has tipped the balance in their favor?][? if (was_in_center_right_coalition == 1 and pro_republic_8 >= 70 and pro_republic >= 70) and not (weimar_ref_signatures < 30 and pro_republic_8 >= 70) and not (young_plan_signatures < 10 and pro_republic_8 < 70): the national opinion increasingly shifting in favor of <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ub</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">lic</span>?]. 

Godwin Trevannon has been elected as leader of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, a member of the "Young Conservative" faction and is supportive of transforming the party into a constructive conservative force, akin to the <span style="color: #0087DC;">Fulyrian crown conservatives</span>. The defeat of the radical right and national conservative forces within the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> helps pave the way for Trevannon' vision of a <span style="color: #87CEFA;">Faithful Democratic</span>, albeit nationalist party. [? if stegerwald_path: As a result of Sedgewick capturing the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>'s working-class voters, the party is refocusing to reach out to Faithful. ?]